  description: "During the Main Phase: You can discard 1 card, then activate 1 of
    these effects;\r\n\u25CF Special Summon 1 Gemini monster from your Deck as an
    Effect Monster that gains its effects.\r\n\u25CF Tribute 1 Gemini monster, and
    if you do, Special Summon 1 FIRE Warrior monster from your hand or Deck. Then,
    if you Tributed a Gemini monster that was treated as an Effect Monster and had
    gained its effects, you can also destroy 1 card on the field.\r\nYou can only
    use this effect of \"Gemini Ablation\" once per turn."
